#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:94
msgctxt "Description for Excluded products setting"
msgid "All products are eligible for affiliate commission by default. If you want to exclude some, list them here."
msgstr "Tous les produits sont éligibles à la commission d'affiliation par défaut. Si vous souhaitez en exclure certains, listez-les ici."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:102
msgctxt "placeholder for excluded products setting"
msgid "Search by product name or ID"
msgstr "Recherche par nom de produit ou ID"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:107
msgctxt "Approval method setting name"
msgid "Approval method"
msgstr "Méthode d'approbation"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:108
msgctxt "Description for Approval method setting"
msgid "Automatically approve all submissions via Affiliate Registration Form - no manual review needed"
msgstr "Approuver automatiquement toutes les soumissions via le formulaire d'inscription des affiliés - aucune vérification manuelle n'est nécessaire."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:112
msgctxt "Description for Approval method setting tooltip"
msgid "Disabling this will require you to review and approve affiliates yourself. They won't become affiliates until you approve."
msgstr "Si vous désactivez cette fonction, vous devrez examiner et approuver les affiliés vous-même. Ils ne deviendront pas affiliés tant que vous ne les aurez pas approuvés."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:116
msgctxt "Cookie duration setting name"
msgid "Cookie duration (in days)"
msgstr "Durée du cookie (en jours)"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:117
msgctxt "Description for Cookie duration setting"
msgid "Use 0 for \"session only\" referrals. Use 36500 for 100 year / lifetime referrals. If someone makes a purchase within these many days of their first referred visit, affiliate will be credited for the sale."
msgstr "Utilisez 0 pour les références \"session uniquement\". Utilisez 36500 pour les parrainages sur 100 ans ou à vie. Si une personne effectue un achat dans les jours qui suivent sa première visite, l'affilié sera crédité pour la vente."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:128
msgctxt "Affiliate manager email setting name"
msgid "Affiliate manager email"
msgstr "Courriel du gestionnaire d'affiliation"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:129
msgctxt "Description for Affiliate manager email setting"
msgid "Affiliates will see a link to contact you in their dashboard - and the link will point to this email address. Leave this field blank to hide the contact link."
msgstr "Les affiliés verront un lien pour vous contacter dans leur tableau de bord - et le lien pointera vers cette adresse e-mail. Laissez ce champ vide pour masquer le lien de contact."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:132
msgctxt "Placeholder for Affiliate manager email setting"
msgid "Enter email address"
msgstr "Saisir l'adresse électronique"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:137
msgctxt "Affiliate landing pages setting name"
msgid "Affiliate landing pages"
msgstr "Pages d'atterrissage pour les affiliés"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:138
msgctxt "Description for Affiliate landing pages setting"
msgid "Enable this to allow assigning landing pages, posts, or products to an affiliate"
msgstr "Activez cette option pour permettre l'attribution de pages d'atterrissage, d'articles ou de produits à un affilié."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-general-admin-settings.php:139
msgctxt "Description tip for Affiliate landing pages setting"
msgid "Use the <code>Affiliate Landing Page</code> meta box on a single page, post, or product to assign it to an affiliate which they can promote without using an affiliate link. The commission will be calculated based on the commission plan."
msgstr "Utilisez la méta-boîte <code>Affiliate Landing Page</code> sur une page, un article ou un produit unique pour l'attribuer à un affilié qui pourra en faire la promotion sans utiliser de lien d'affiliation. La commission sera calculée en fonction du plan de commission."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:403
msgctxt "Admin setting name for Payout invoice"
msgid "Payout invoice"
msgstr "Facture de paiement"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:404
msgctxt "Admin setting description for Payout invoice"
msgid "Enable this to generate an invoice for each commission payout"
msgstr "Activez cette option pour générer une facture pour chaque paiement de commission."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:409
msgctxt "Admin setting description tip for Payout invoice"
msgid "When enabled, you can print invoices from the Payouts tab. To allow affiliates to print their invoices, enable the \"Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice\" below."
msgstr "Lorsque cette option est activée, vous pouvez imprimer les factures à partir de l'onglet Paiements. Pour permettre aux affiliés d'imprimer leurs factures, activez l'option \"Afficher et permettre aux affiliés d'imprimer leur facture\" ci-dessous."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:413
msgctxt "Admin setting description for Logo for payout invoice"
msgid "Upload a logo representing your shop or business. It will be shown on the invoice."
msgstr "Téléchargez un logo représentant votre magasin ou votre entreprise. Il apparaîtra sur la facture."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:423
msgctxt "Admin setting name for Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgid "Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgstr "Afficher et permettre aux affiliés d'imprimer leur facture"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:428
msgctxt "Admin setting description tip for Show and allow affiliates to print their invoice"
msgid "When enabled, a new column to print invoices will be visible in the affiliate's account > Reports > Payout History."
msgstr "Lorsque cette option est activée, une nouvelle colonne permettant d'imprimer les factures sera visible dans le compte de l'affilié > Rapports > Historique des paiements."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:621
msgctxt "Button text for media upload button"
msgid "Upload image"
msgstr "Télécharger l'image"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-afwc-payouts-admin-settings.php:622
